      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DENNIS KEEPING (6) flew the lids with a strong early split and led throughout to score an impressive win by 3.5 lengths over 520m at this track (29.36). Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. The hardest to beat again. MAGIC BANDIT (3) placed last time (29.69) at this track in a NG, finishing third and beaten 11 lengths. Already a winner from this draw. Looks well placed here and among the chances. MY PHARAOH (1) was below best last time finishing fourth at this track, but prior to that had been racing well including a Grade 4/5 win two back at this track. Expecting sharp improvement this line-up. FASCINATE SAMUEL (2) is always a threat when he draws this box.",
